<article class="offering-card consulting-card">
  <div class="offering-photo">
    <img src="/assets/images/rvpurchasequestions.png" alt="Pre-purchase consultation with Professor Jerry"
      loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="offering-body">
    <h2 id="prepurchaseconsultation">Pre-Purchase Consultation</h2>
    <p>
      Buying your first RV can feel overwhelming. Should you choose a towable RV or a
      motorhome? A bumper-pull trailer or a fifth wheel? A Class A, B, C, or Super C?
      If you already have a tow vehicle, its tow rating is only one part of figuring
      out which trailers are a good match. If you&rsquo;re leaning toward a motorhome,
      you may want to know whether you can tow your car behind it. Then there&rsquo;s
      the question of which accessories you&rsquo;ll actually need, such as an anti-sway
      bar or a rear-view camera. The hardest part
      is often just knowing what questions to ask before you buy. 
    </p>

    <p>
      Professor Jerry&rsquo;s Pre-Purchase Consultation includes three hours of
      one-on-one video calls that you can spread across one calendar month.
      We&rsquo;ll start with how you plan to use your RV and what matters most to you.
      As you find models you&rsquo;re considering, we can review their specs together,
      discuss how they match up with the vehicle you plan to tow with or tow behind,
      and use your remaining time for questions that come up along the way.
    </p>

    <p>
      I&rsquo;ll help you compare the RVs on your shortlist, understand the trade-offs,
      and spot questions worth asking the seller. You make the final call with a
      clearer picture of how each RV fits your plans.
    </p>
    <div class="offering-price">
      <rv:price regular="289" discount="<%= GRAND_OPENING_PERCENT %>" />
    </div>
  </div>
</article>